workspaces.keyboard = Kiyibhodhi: Alt+↑/↓ inosarudza marongerwo. Ctrl/Cmd+N inogadzirisa zita rawo; +S inochengeta kopi; +Enter inoashandisa; +U inoavandudza; +R inoatumidza patsva; +D inoadzima; +0 inoadzorera pakutanga.
